  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Are you ready? To discard pieces of C-stones, ",
      "there is a lot of hard work involved. If you activate ",
      "these pieces in the area where they can be ",
      "activated, magical power will come out.",
      "They will look like monsters, according to",
      "Royal Mage. You can get a small piece after ",
      "killing this monster. We call this piece the",
      "'Evidence of killing evil things.'",
      "",
      "Pieces can be activated in the north",
      "of special place at Lost Temple. There are",
      "many pieces, but pieces of C-stone have very",
      "powerful evil properties. Discard just 7 of them,",
      "and bring me the proof.",
      "",
      "Take care of yourself and good luck to you.",
      "I will be seeing you with this good news."
    ]
  },
